#: ../../contribute/glossary.md:5 1e29250d05474acb9fe72f136703ca80
msgid "📘 Glossary"
msgstr "📘 术语表"

#: ../../contribute/glossary.md:7 e14c5b298b564fd586628374e155e1d3
msgid "These words have a specific meaning in this project:"
msgstr "以下词汇在本项目中有特定含义："

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:2 20adc705a45d4cc594ceb6444886681b
msgid "General concepts"
msgstr "通用概念"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:3 2a27514395d54654986a55a1132fc19e
msgid "**Bundle**"
msgstr "**捆绑包**"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:4 1b82216511b040e0bc60c3907026c13a
msgid "A set of modules packaged together for distribution."
msgstr "一组打包在一起用于分发的模块。"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:5 e73d9974912e40549f9c8b7028acbf69
msgid "**Dependency**"
msgstr "**依赖项**"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:6 8042e0474c394db9b48ca88d48c1cc04
msgid ""
"A module that another module relies on to function properly. It must be "
"loaded for the dependent module to work."
msgstr "另一个模块正常运行所依赖的模块。必须加载依赖项，依赖它的模块才能工作。"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:7 9e713bfea8734c0886dd538743e60c73
msgid "**Feature**"
msgstr "**特性**"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:8 514c5c9b90f24272a41adaa95007ae8b
msgid ""
"A user-facing element designed to accomplish a task. Features are often "
"represented as function tags, but can also include predicates, number "
"providers, loot tables, tags, and more."
msgstr "一个面向用户的、用于完成特定任务的元素。特性通常表现为函数标签，但也可以包括谓词、数值提供器、战利品表、标签等。"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:9 f9eeb70987924a05894f764ab616bbcf
msgid "**Module**"
msgstr "**模块**"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:10 7404e5ff11794d34baf9b40e76d52d07
msgid ""
"A collection of related features within a namespace, serving a specific "
"purpose."
msgstr "命名空间内服务于特定目的的相关特性集合。"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:11 a533384aa5cc4825adba02604dc4879f
msgid "**Weak Dependency**"
msgstr "**弱依赖项**"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:12 75f403a6cb964b7aa27d15ed84aaf8c4
msgid ""
"An optional dependency that enhances functionality if present, but is not"
" essential for the main module to function correctly."
msgstr "可选的依赖项，存在时可增强功能，但并非主模块正常运行所必需。"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:15 d61dc1c2d4c44dc787e71fa1422069c2
msgid "Special arguments"
msgstr "特殊参数"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:16 de4c6c2a792145b99739621331d9d827
msgid "**`run`**"
msgstr "**`run`**"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:17 70cf660d100d46c3baec408c3b72605f
msgid "Specifies a command to be executed by a feature."
msgstr "指定由特性执行的命令。"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:18 35d34820b97d4907b60de66881adf56d
msgid "**`with`**"
msgstr "**`with`**"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:19 e5a990d1f069473396ed6c5928e8081b
msgid "Groups the optional arguments of a feature called with a macro."
msgstr "将通过宏调用的特性的可选参数归为一组。"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:22 486c4d1b74954caba4ea0c4ab3a6d25b
msgid "Special functions"
msgstr "特殊函数"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:23 fde741bb1af1492eb73ec7c6198bc7e0
msgid "**`*.in`**"
msgstr "**`*.in`**"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:24 f40d5343743d4c8693b9c811c1e433b0
msgid ""
"The function tag that takes the inputs of a feature as macro arguments, "
"instead of reading them from its storage."
msgstr "以宏参数的形式接收特性输入的函数标签，而不是从其存储中读取输入。"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:25 2178bd2515104e208b97421678b0e05e
msgid "**`*_ata`**"
msgstr "**`*_ata`**"

#: ../../_templates/definitions.md:26 8155ad6c62bb4454aeb42f346c93789a
msgid ""
"Shortened from \"as to at.\" These functions take two positions: one "
"given through a positional argument (e.g., `positioned`, `at`), and the "
"other from the executor's position."
msgstr ""
"源自 \"as to at\" 的缩写。这些函数接收两个位置：一个通过位置参数（如 "
"`positioned`、`at`）提供，另一个来自执行者的位置。"

#: ../../contribute/glossary.md:14 fc81fa04e5b4470183279190550a0b6a
msgid "Contributor concepts"
msgstr "贡献者概念"

#: ../../contribute/glossary.md:15 9673c2f23a694596967134c8d71744fd
msgid "**Experimental**"
msgstr "**实验性**"

#: ../../contribute/glossary.md:16 d7d91051778a4553807feaed3c606acd
msgid "A feature that isn't ready. Only nightly builds include it."
msgstr "尚未就绪的特性。只有每夜构建包含它。"

#: ../../contribute/glossary.md:17 8175c220376e45c2ae9b51bdd0525b8a
msgid "**Group**"
msgstr "**分组**"

#: ../../contribute/glossary.md:18 d0150a83d04f49e2bd73d94a23a38dec
msgid "A folder that contains several features and the files that they share."
msgstr "包含多个特性及其共享文件的文件夹。"

#: ../../contribute/glossary.md:19 64abe0a8c59e4d5fba441cb7c5e63336
msgid "**Private**"
msgstr "**私有**"

#: ../../contribute/glossary.md:20 41238f08ebab4b298d1e347dc71d67b0
msgid ""
"A file that only its feature or group can use. Functions are always "
"private. Other files are private when they have a `_` prefix."
msgstr "只有其所属的特性或分组可以使用的文件。函数始终是私有的。其他文件带有 `_` 前缀时为私有。"

#: ../../contribute/glossary.md:21 cf460784dc7a400d9e859ff7331b31c5
msgid "**Released**"
msgstr "**已发布**"

#: ../../contribute/glossary.md:22 ed77957622d74690b8296acd42529e54
msgid "A module whose version reached `1.0.0`."
msgstr "版本已达到 `1.0.0` 的模块。"

